# Implementation Plan - Database Admin Panel

Providing administrative visibility and bulk actions for the AyurStock Pro database via a secure dashboard section.

## Proposed Changes

### [API] Database Statistics
Create a new endpoint to fetch record counts for key models.

#### [NEW] [db-stats/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/admin/db-stats/route.ts)
- Fetch counts for [Medicine](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/medicines/page.tsx#28-35), [InventoryBatch](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/inventory/page.tsx#22-34), [Sale](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/page.tsx#14-18), `Purchase`, and `Supplier`.
- Enforce `ADMIN` role check.

### [API] Medicine Export
Create a new endpoint to export all medicines as a CSV file.

#### [NEW] [export/route.ts](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/api/medicines/export/route.ts)
- Fetch all medicines for the authenticated `shopId`.
- Format data as CSV and return with appropriate headers for download.

### [Frontend] Database Admin UI
Implement the new dashboard section.

#### [NEW] [database-admin.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/components/settings/database-admin.tsx)
- Display table counts in a grid of cards.
- Integrate the "Clear All Medicines" action (with confirmation).
- Add an "Export as CSV" button.
- Provide a paginated table to view raw medicine data.

#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx)
- Add "Database Admin" to `SETTINGS_CATEGORIES` (Advanced group).
- Add the `database` tab to [renderContent](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx#65-80).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- Run `npm run lint` and `npm run build`.

### Manual Verification
- Verify the "Database Admin" tab is only visible to `ADMIN` users.
- Confirm table counts update correctly after imports or deletions.
- Test the "Export as CSV" functionality.
- Verify the raw data table displays correctly.
